+ *
+ * The Samsung SDP SoC places reserved memory regions in a /sdp_mmap
+ * device-tree node as named u32[3] properties (index 0 is unused,
+ * index 1 is the physical address, index 2 is the size).  The GP plane's
+ * framebuffer is "samsung,gfx0".
+ *
